{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0c890fbf-4c5f-59da-a65f-93de44f3d892", "source_ordinal": 2752, "reading_ordinal": 1301, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "抗骚扰", "published_at": "2022-06-11T06:51:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/537038241/answer/2523646801"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个说实话是很难有什么好办法彻底避免的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "理论上说可以通过“避免去低端业态消费”和“关注环境危险”之类的方法降低概率，但这不是万全之策。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "要说有什么有点效果的方法，大概是这几条——", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "1）保持镇定，尽量控制对话情绪，尽量避免激化矛盾。", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "其实常在江湖飘的话，这类场面并不罕见。尤其是下面的地县乡，常有成群结队的纹身青少年闲游，一不小心就会意外引起这种话赶话的危险僵局。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 182}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "客观讲，这种僵局是自有一些灵活的应对可以化解的。一些老江湖——比如一些开亲民店的老板娘们——常能几句话把场面扭转错开，把对方的情绪从那个焦躁不安、恶向胆边生的状态调整出来。", "char_start": 183, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这是处理这类问题最有效的手段。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "但实话实说，这手段对绝大多数人都不现实。这是混江湖历练出来的街头智慧，能办到的人自带一种隐藏在“豪爽热情”下的狠气。这也是这些摊主店主能做稳这些是非多的夜市生意的必要条件。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "可惜这对年轻人来说属实有操作困难。大家书香门第，普遍乖学生出身，不是天赋异禀，难有这样的历练和能力。没有这个能力，就很难掌握住“不卑不亢”的分寸，也控制不住这个气场。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不过这毕竟是最好的处置，不能不提。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "2）撤退。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一般来说，做人的通行战略原则是不主动打无准备的遭遇战。", "char_start": 481, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "如果冲突的时间、地点、规则不是你主动选择的，而是出乎你意料的遭遇的，那么我建议你第一时间不要浪费任何精力在“勇者胜”上，而放在妥善撤退上。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 578}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "什么叫妥善撤退？", "char_start": 579, "char_end": 587}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这主要指两条——", "char_start": 588, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "第一，不要在任何阶段放弃反击的机会。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "军队怎么撤退？交替掩护，依次向对自己有利的阻击阵地出发。敌人要追，每一站都会是仓促追击的部队遭遇早已在战壕里严阵以待、以逸待劳的阻击部队，只会遭遇惨重伏击。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "连续因为追击受到损失，敌军会自己放弃追击，从而可以让部队从容的收拾、有序的进入第二防线。", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 739}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "妥善的撤退，从来不是纯跑路，而是跑向对敌人危险而对自己有利的路。", "char_start": 740, "char_end": 772}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "比如，往红绿灯路口跑，往银行门口跑，往附近的政府机关跑，往消防局、警局、学校跑。", "char_start": 773, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这些地方因为特殊的监控和保安需求，不是有可靠的监控，就是有专业的保安人员。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 851}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "跑动过程中如果有机会给追逐者制造麻烦，顺手给ta制造困难——拉倒自行车，拽倒纸盒子，寻找趁手的武器——短棍、刀具——抄到手里，不是要掉头去跟ta打，而是接着跑。", "char_start": 852, "char_end": 932}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "一边跑一边喊“抓贼啊”“非礼啊”“强奸啊”——不要喊“杀人啦”。你喊“杀人”，沿路的人会躲；你喊“抓贼”，那就不一样了——尤其是对方是空手追你的话，路人会干预的可能性大得多。", "char_start": 933, "char_end": 1020}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "不要光只顾速度，要越跑越对你有利，对ta越不利。", "char_start": 1021, "char_end": 1045}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "如果是几个人，那么可以几个人掩护一个跑，只要有人跑掉，就意味着逃脱者会立刻报警叫人，留在现场的歹徒就会慌乱紧张。", "char_start": 1046, "char_end": 1102}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "ta们就算是揪住了掩护者，也是赶紧想着要赶紧离场，免得被抓现行。这一点，留下的人可以大声提醒ta们——“警察马上到！警察马上到！”", "char_start": 1103, "char_end": 1168}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不是别的，有些蠢人——能干这些事的人一般智力发育就多少有点缺陷，你不清楚喊出来，对方可能蠢到自己意识不到。", "char_start": 1169, "char_end": 1222}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "跑掉的这个人自己脑子要清楚，你第一时间就要报警，你别tm自己跑high了，只知道自己拼命跑。", "char_start": 1223, "char_end": 1269}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "但是现场这个也不必纠结跑掉的到底报警没有，甚至都不用真的有人跑掉，你只管喊“已经报警了，警察马上到”，因为对方也没法确认跑掉的这个报没报，也没法确认围观的人有没有人报，ta们慌乱之下是不太敢赌的。", "char_start": 1270, "char_end": 1368}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "前提是你要清楚明白的提醒ta们，让ta们没办法无视这个巨大威胁。", "char_start": 1369, "char_end": 1401}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "3）如果你跑不掉，那么你要注意保护自己的要害准备扛打击。", "char_start": 1403, "char_end": 1431}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "典型的办法是往复杂地形里选，而不要在开阔地跟优势数量的对手对抗。", "char_start": 1432, "char_end": 1464}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "就算是抱头挨打，缩在墙角、墙边也要比被围在空地上好——在墙角要围殴你人都不好站位。", "char_start": 1465, "char_end": 1506}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "桌子底下也不是坏选择。", "char_start": 1507, "char_end": 1518}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "蜷缩着抱住电线杆也可以。", "char_start": 1519, "char_end": 1531}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "甚至随手拽把椅子顶在头上死死抱住也可以。", "char_start": 1532, "char_end": 1552}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "你抱着一个坚硬的固定物，其实要围殴你是不容易的。", "char_start": 1553, "char_end": 1577}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "业余人激情攻击，ta们极其容易打偏，更何况你还会胡乱闪躲。", "char_start": 1578, "char_end": 1607}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "猛击打到踢到铸铁长椅、水泥电线杆、固定垃圾桶、柜台、共享单车三角架、水泥墙上，极其容易造成骨折和扭伤。", "char_start": 1608, "char_end": 1659}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "这还不是你主动攻击的结果，完全是ta们自作自受、纯活该。", "char_start": 1660, "char_end": 1688}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "附近如果有水池，而你熟知水性，你还可以下水。", "char_start": 1689, "char_end": 1711}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "奇妙的是这些人看似凶神恶煞，但却很少有舍得为了追击别人打湿衣服的。", "char_start": 1712, "char_end": 1745}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "而且一旦下了水，要围殴是非常困难的，而且拳打脚踢的威力会自然被水缓冲。在水里要站稳都不是很容易，要围殴你非常困难。尤其是你努力游开的话，激情攻击者很少会下水游泳追你。", "char_start": 1746, "char_end": 1829}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "当然，前提是这个水体你确实清楚没有危险，而且你水性纯熟。", "char_start": 1830, "char_end": 1858}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "4）再谈自卫工具问题。", "char_start": 1860, "char_end": 1871}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "首先，要明确的一点是，女性不能选用靠体力运用的自卫武器，比如甩棍、战术/自卫笔、自卫电筒这些。", "char_start": 1872, "char_end": 1919}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "最理想的选择其实是辣椒素喷射器，但是在我国使用压缩空气为动力的辣椒素喷射器是管制物品。", "char_start": 1920, "char_end": 1963}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "你也别抱怨，这就是现实。也不是没有道理——因为这些容器要是在密闭空间——比如地铁车厢、乘用车里自己意外破裂，很容易造成人员伤亡。在高速上司机突然意外的睁不开眼睛了，你想想这有多危险。", "char_start": 1964, "char_end": 2055}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "所以不要无谓抱怨。", "char_start": 2056, "char_end": 2065}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "但是直接用人力按压的自制辣椒剂喷雾是合法的。", "char_start": 2066, "char_end": 2088}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "拿一个空的高品质香水喷雾分装瓶重新灌装一小瓶，雾越细越好。", "char_start": 2089, "char_end": 2118}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "注意，按压头必须有牢固硬盖保护——你不会希望打开包突然“感动”得痛哭流涕。", "char_start": 2119, "char_end": 2156}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "有这个在手，你逃跑会容易很多。", "char_start": 2157, "char_end": 2172}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "比如突然喷几下，在面前创造一堵细雾墙再扭头跑，对方要追你就会迎面撞上这面气墙，瞬间就会丧失视力——这也是为什么特别强调要用香水分装瓶。", "char_start": 2173, "char_end": 2240}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "不要用几块钱那种，很容易泄露。", "char_start": 2241, "char_end": 2256}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "要至少一百多的，既不泄漏（你不会希望到用的时候已经挥发没了），雾也够细，而且外形自然。", "char_start": 2257, "char_end": 2300}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "至于辣椒素，本来就是常见的食品添加剂，直接购买就可以了。", "char_start": 2301, "char_end": 2329}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "特别提醒——这东西不能随身携带上飞机，自己注意自觉点。", "char_start": 2330, "char_end": 2357}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "另一个就是智能报警器，以下功能要齐全——", "char_start": 2359, "char_end": 2379}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "list", "index": 60, "text": "GPS定位功能\n插sim卡\n双击自动发送位置信息给紧急联系人，方便家人救援和报警。\n可以静音开启远程通话，使得远端可以直接听见现场声音。\n有配套的app，可以设置远程安全监护服务。一旦报警，有在线客服会电话联系你或在无法联系时直接根据位置信息报警。\n有插销式的高分贝警报功能。紧急情况下拔掉插销，警报器就会高分贝啸叫引起路人注意，并为警察提供声音指引。使用时立刻扔掉插销，以免歹徒找到插销关闭警报。\n超长待机，缺电提示。", "char_start": 2380, "char_end": 2590}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "list", "index": 61, "text": "GPS定位功能", "char_start": 2380, "char_end": 2387}, {"paragraph_id": "P062", "field": "list", "index": 62, "text": "插sim卡", "char_start": 2388, "char_end": 2393}, {"paragraph_id": "P063", "field": "list", "index": 63, "text": "双击自动发送位置信息给紧急联系人，方便家人救援和报警。", "char_start": 2394, "char_end": 2421}, {"paragraph_id": "P064", "field": "list", "index": 64, "text": "可以静音开启远程通话，使得远端可以直接听见现场声音。", "char_start": 2422, "char_end": 2448}, {"paragraph_id": "P065", "field": "list", "index": 65, "text": "有配套的app，可以设置远程安全监护服务。一旦报警，有在线客服会电话联系你或在无法联系时直接根据位置信息报警。", "char_start": 2449, "char_end": 2504}, {"paragraph_id": "P066", "field": "list", "index": 66, "text": "有插销式的高分贝警报功能。紧急情况下拔掉插销，警报器就会高分贝啸叫引起路人注意，并为警察提供声音指引。使用时立刻扔掉插销，以免歹徒找到插销关闭警报。", "char_start": 2505, "char_end": 2579}, {"paragraph_id": "P067", "field": "list", "index": 67, "text": "超长待机，缺电提示。", "char_start": 2580, "char_end": 2590}, {"paragraph_id": "P068", "field": "body", "index": 68, "text": "到电商上搜一下“自卫警报器”，自己根据条件筛选。", "char_start": 2592, "char_end": 2616}, {"paragraph_id": "P069", "field": "body", "index": 69, "text": "别说没提醒你——看到这时候要是没想到送女朋友/妻子一个，你这恋爱谈得……欠打。", "char_start": 2617, "char_end": 2656}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 64, "list": 1, "listitem": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0207"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：唐山某路烧烤店，男子骚扰女子未果挨骂，随即动手打人，将受到哪些惩罚？出门在外如何保护好自身安全？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061", "P062", "P063", "P064", "P065", "P066", "P067", "P068", "P069"], "summary": "围绕“抗骚扰”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个说实话是很难有什么好办法彻底避免的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个说实话是很难有什么好办法彻底避免的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9219aa2c-84a5-512d-9343-288bf28df1ea", "source_ordinal": 2751, "reading_ordinal": 1302, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "我的自由与你的安全", "published_at": "2022-06-11T07:54:25+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/462633806/answer/2523677473"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "居然有人说“看不出自由和安全有什么矛盾”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "乡亲们躲在地窖里，楼上就是日本兵，你来一个“自由和安全不矛盾”试试。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "自由和安全的关系没什么好争辩的——也许你可以把你自己的安全摆在你自己的自由之后，", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但你绝对没有资格和权利把别人的安全摆在你自己的自由后面。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“把别人的安全摆在自己的自由之后”，即是敌人的本质定义。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一个人主张“我的自由比你的安全重要”，这人就是在对你公然宣战。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因为如果这能成立，那日寇岂不是丧失了“把中国的安全放在日本的自由之后”的“合法权利”？", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 231}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "说出来之前，建议多点自我怀疑。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 247}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不然很容易犯这种徒具形式优美，实则根本站不住的错误。", "char_start": 248, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "美不是真，", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不是够美就够真。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 289}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0207"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：疫情面前自由重要还是生命重要？为什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“我的自由与你的安全”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“居然有人说“看不出自由和安全有什么矛盾”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "居然有人说“看不出自由和安全有什么矛盾”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "827cceb1-fcbe-52ee-8f35-00d4c2a242c5", "source_ordinal": 2750, "reading_ordinal": 1303, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "社会化", "published_at": "2022-06-12T00:30:38+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/21789164/answer/2524848159"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我曾经说过，父母对子女的主要教育职责就是帮助子女完成正确的社会化。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但是我发现这里的社会化概念需要特别厘清一下，以免各位父母拿着各种教科书往上套。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为一般教育界所谓的社会化是指帮助儿童理解和接受现有社会的规则和现状，以成为该社会的一名合格（functional）成员。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但这其实不是社会化，而是【xx社会化】。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你在教导ta匹配什么社会，那就是xx社会化。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "教ta匹配中国社会，那么这叫中国社会化。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "教ta匹配美国社会，那么这叫美国社会化。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "然后你发现问题没有？", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这些“中国社会化”、“美国社会化”，如果要缩写简称，该省去的不该是“中国”和“美国”，变成“社会化”，而应该省去“社会”，变成“中国化”、“美国化”。", "char_start": 233, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "换言之，各国教育界在谈的所谓的社会化，实际上是本地化、公民化。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这在本质上并不是真正的社会化，而是对社会化名义的一个有意无意的占用。", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "其差异约等于一所以篮球见长的学校，将一群报考运动学专业的学生，教成了篮球学学士。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 416}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "虽然篮球的确是一种运动，但运动学专业和篮球学专业的课程设置和侧重方向是完全不同的。", "char_start": 417, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这种“社会化”和我一直所论述的社会化不是一回事。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我所谈论的社会化，是超越于具体的意识形态之上的，这是它的首要而且核心的关注。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 523}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "它的重点是如何与意识形态未知、多元、与你对立以及随时变化的人群低成本的建立和维持有可持续性的健壮的社会合作。", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 578}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "所以，我所论述的核心，是大量的基本问题——如何交谈、如何信任、如何面对分歧、如何面对契约、如何面对怀疑、如何面对诽谤、如何面对憎恶、如何帮助、如何战斗、如何逃离……", "char_start": 579, "char_end": 661}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "在我的论述中，你会发现这些交谈、信任、分歧、契约、怀疑、诽谤、憎恶、帮助、战斗、逃离的对手方是没有意识形态差异的。", "char_start": 662, "char_end": 719}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "无论你是东方还是西方、有神还是无神、激进还是保守甚至正或邪、善或恶、贵或贱，放进这些论述的宾格里，都不会改变它的谓词成分——不会导致方法的动摇。", "char_start": 720, "char_end": 792}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "我所讲述的社会化，是要让一个人去适应社会这个事物本身，而不是去适应当前的社会、或者某人所设想的未来的社会、或者中国社会、或者美国社会。", "char_start": 793, "char_end": 860}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "就是社会本身。", "char_start": 861, "char_end": 868}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "就像教运动学的，教的就是运动学，而不是篮球学、足球学或者剑术。", "char_start": 869, "char_end": 900}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这个用意是你学好了运动学，你再去学篮球也罢、学足球也罢，甚至膝盖踢碎了要改气步枪也罢，都能事半功倍、得心应手。", "char_start": 901, "char_end": 956}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "社会用纳税人的钱办公立教育，它们谈论的社会化当然是指它们自己的公民化，是力求让受教者匹配自己的现状和自己的战略愿景。", "char_start": 957, "char_end": 1015}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "所以它们一直在强调的是塑造认同。", "char_start": 1016, "char_end": 1032}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "注意，这不是在吐槽或者反对它，因为这是理所当然的——不这样，岂不是在浪费纳税人的税金？", "char_start": 1033, "char_end": 1076}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "但这和父母要去教授的社会化不是一回事。", "char_start": 1077, "char_end": 1096}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "父母们需要的是自己的子女无论遇到什么样的人、进入什么样的组织、被命运带去哪里，都能及时、有效、风险可控的与ta人良性的合作，最大限度的保证安全、获得资源、有所成就。", "char_start": 1097, "char_end": 1179}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "要的是自己的子女能开山立派、成祖成宗、立德立言。", "char_start": 1180, "char_end": 1204}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "要的是孩子们永不至于孤苦、永远不至于绝望。", "char_start": 1205, "char_end": 1226}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "所以我在讲的，是不判断（no judging）、宽容、信心和爱。", "char_start": 1227, "char_end": 1259}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "看懂了吗？", "char_start": 1260, "char_end": 1265}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "以后记住这个差别。", "char_start": 1266, "char_end": 1275}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 34}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0207"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：何为社会化？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033"], "summary": "围绕“社会化”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我曾经说过，父母对子女的主要教育职责就是帮助子女完成正确的社会化。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我曾经说过，父母对子女的主要教育职责就是帮助子女完成正确的社会化。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "83b5aef7-2025-5e0e-89df-5e329b53fc3c", "source_ordinal": 2749, "reading_ordinal": 1304, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "分得清", "published_at": "2022-06-12T13:03:04+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/537197073/answer/2525354255"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "1）对你认定不该分的事情自然不存在“分得清”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "2）对“哪些事情不该分清”这必须分得清。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "3）你的细分规则，除非共同约定，否则是你单方面的决定，对方没有服从义务，也没有对等交换义务。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "4）人欠你的，你才有权不分清；你欠人的，你无权不分清。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "总的来说，", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "是，要分清，包括“哪些不用分清”也要分清。", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这跟爱怎么兼容？", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "爱是不求回报的付出。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这是“被确定放弃的债权”", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 180}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0207"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：恋爱中应该要凡事分得清吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“分得清”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“1）对你认定不该分的事情自然不存在“分得清”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "1）对你认定不该分的事情自然不存在“分得清”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e37940f2-5632-554f-b5ab-19592157779d", "source_ordinal": 2748, "reading_ordinal": 1305, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "扫黑除恶", "published_at": "2022-06-12T19:29:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/537242054/answer/2525800100"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实，每逢经济形势不好或者社会气氛紧张，捞偏门的老大们都要当点心，因为这意味着扫黑除恶的季节很快到了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "平时海清河晏，国泰民安，这类打架事件往往在治安层面骚动一下，常规处理。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一旦景气不顺，很容易导致大面积的民意焦躁不安，高度缺乏安全感。一旦有任何平民遇害的典型案件发生，都可能大面积的触发共鸣。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "要触发海啸般的愤怒。", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "历史每到这些章节，政府总会做两件事——第一是赈济，第二就是打黑。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这时候顺势而为，发动大规模的治安行动对管理层显而易见的顺理成章。这策略顺天应民，大快人心，成本又不高，同时可以非常有效的巩固民意支持。", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "势必雷霆万钧。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "千里之外的不知什么小混混乱搞一下，就可能触发大规模的严厉整治，连累到自己身边掀起惊涛骇浪。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 314}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "丁点平时觉得“小事一桩”的欺男霸女，这时候都可能变成盘根错节的大祸。", "char_start": 315, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "黑社会也要讲纪律、讲服从，但它坏就坏在在正常的社会里缺少精英加入，总是在底层布满了不识时务又不受控制的蠢人。而且就算是你自己知道风声紧把小弟控制住了，也难保隔壁省不知哪个老大不读书，不识时务，爆个雷来连累你。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "让老百姓尝到了甜头，看出了便宜，连环举报举报起来就知道什么叫四面楚歌了。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 491}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "但这也怪不了谁，", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "出来混，总是要还的。", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 511}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0207"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女子实名举报唐山黑社会团伙，称遭囚禁 16 小时，逼迫下跪关狗笼，警方抓获 4 名嫌犯，具体情况如何？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“扫黑除恶”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实，每逢经济形势不好或者社会气氛紧张，捞偏门的老大们都要当点心，因为这意味着扫黑除恶的季节很快到了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实，每逢经济形势不好或者社会气氛紧张，捞偏门的老大们都要当点心，因为这意味着扫黑除恶的季节很快到了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 51, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b9d32db8-c36e-5931-a4b0-ee9a9d5ffca8", "source_ordinal": 2747, "reading_ordinal": 1306, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "保持善良", "published_at": "2022-06-13T00:35:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/268675200/answer/2526141091"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "就是因为社会很复杂，你才应该一直保持善良。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这道理有啥不明白？", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "善良的活法你都搞不定，你还搞得定不善良的活法？", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "要想活下去，不善良比善良的难度大得多好吗？", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你善良没能出人头地，于是不善良就会攀上人生高峰？", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这就跟用铁锅炖红烧肉没炖烂，看到隔壁邻居从冰箱里拿出一份红烧肉，于是决定改用冷柜做红烧肉一样。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你是不是以为“善良的人都在受恶人的欺负”，所以搞不成事？", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你整个的搞错了。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "首先，善良的人做事失败，大多数情况下是技术原因，跟“恶人捣乱”没啥大关系。不是说这情况没有，而是说这情况不是主要原因。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 249}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "第二，不考虑战争，日常而言，恶人的首要目标很少是善良的人，而恰恰是那些“善良”到一半，觉得自己所有的问题都是因为过于善良，自认为邪恶就是解决方案的半路出家的“菜鸟恶人”。", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "办法很简单，可以直接明牌告诉你。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 353}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "首先悄悄告诉你一个美妙故事——一般都涉及不正当竞争或者某种黑产，不是刷单作弊、内幕交易，就是赌博走私。", "char_start": 354, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你不是相信“恶就是核心竞争力”吗？那这类产业对你当然自带充分说服力。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "再在开头给你点甜头，顺手抓你点把柄。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你想再跑，那可就有点来不及了。转账记录留下了，做事的聊天记录、音频视频都有了。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你再想跑，你跑跑看？都不说打打杀杀这些，直接把资料往你爹妈街坊圈子里一递，老太爷可能直接送医院。", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "但这里我客观劝你一句——这时候你别怕这些要挟，想撤就坚决撤吧。第一，对方自己也怕你鱼死网破，这时候吓唬你的成分居多；第二，这里你不上岸，后面就真的很难回头了。", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 628}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "跑不了，那么你的“用处”就大了。", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 646}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "卷你一笔钱走算是最轻的——你自己就有案子，你拿什么报案？但这种以后也不会再找你了，你只要肯吃闷亏，一般也就完结了——一般懂事的大哥们知道不能再敲你，因为再敲你，你可能拼命，要鱼死网破。", "char_start": 647, "char_end": 739}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这就算最幸运的了。", "char_start": 740, "char_end": 749}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "再高一级叫你找家里人借钱，或者干脆拉朋友下水。赚了钱还分你一点呢。但是这样就意味着你再也别指望洗白回归了。因为这已经自断回头路了。", "char_start": 750, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "再高一级，直接给你把刀，要你去“做事”；给你个套套，要你去带货。", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 848}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "直白点说，就是用你当耗材。", "char_start": 849, "char_end": 862}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你没被抓，那你有得“赚”，但是转眼就会撺掇裹挟你去赌博吸毒，搞得精光，以免你“动力不足”，“工作积极性”下降。", "char_start": 864, "char_end": 919}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这期间你要是被抓了，你不开口自己扛，会给你安家费。你要开口作供，第一，就算你这个案子可以算立功，但被你攀扯出来的小头目如果落网，ta手里还有大量有关你别的案子的线索。那些你也算戴罪立功吗？第二，你觉得第二是什么？", "char_start": 921, "char_end": 1027}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你说你是不是耗材？", "char_start": 1028, "char_end": 1037}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "就算你自己没被抓，你看都看得到一堆比你更菜的当了耗材。", "char_start": 1038, "char_end": 1065}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "在耗材这一级，你也没得嚣张。你不是大哥，你也没有什么面子——这些面子只够别的大哥会顾及你大哥的面子不整你，都不够你自己欺男霸女用的。你在良民面前还是要夹着尾巴老老实实，你要是敢不知自己的斤两在外面给大哥惹麻烦，大哥马上淘汰你——大哥自己风险极大，谁要留随时惹事的小弟？", "char_start": 1067, "char_end": 1201}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "怎么“淘汰”？是给你N+1请你另找工作吗？你想得美哦。", "char_start": 1202, "char_end": 1229}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "安排你去缅甸、柬埔寨出差，找狗哥。狗哥口才很好，他会说服你“缅甸非常适合你”。这很可能是家人最后一次知道你的消息。", "char_start": 1230, "char_end": 1287}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "第二条发展路线，就是时间久了安排你做把柄更大的脏活——比如沾血、卖货、当个小头目。到了这一级，不是刑事重罪、就是“组织团伙”，判刑十年起步。", "char_start": 1289, "char_end": 1359}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "到这一步，你就算有字号了。这个在江湖上真的会有点面子。自然，在局里也会有你的文件夹了。", "char_start": 1360, "char_end": 1403}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你也有机会真的间接接触到真正的大哥。你也会因为接触了真正的大哥和机密，出事会有安家费。", "char_start": 1404, "char_end": 1447}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你自己就是大哥和小兵之间的防火墙。", "char_start": 1448, "char_end": 1465}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你的小弟惹了任何事，都要到你为止。天大的事，你都要自觉扛。大哥多的道理不会给你讲，你混到这个地步自己就该懂。懂不了，你也上不去。", "char_start": 1466, "char_end": 1530}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "为什么这些老大都戴观音，拿佛珠？因为做到这一步已经看到自己的结果了——总有一天要完蛋的。完不完蛋根本不是自己努力就可以保证，再努力碰上了倒霉也没得跑。", "char_start": 1531, "char_end": 1606}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "出来混，就预着这天。只指望龙头大哥到时候看自己果断、义气，保住老婆孩子——如果有老婆孩子的话。", "char_start": 1607, "char_end": 1654}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "自己就当自己已经死了。", "char_start": 1655, "char_end": 1666}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "这一级的大哥其实已经到了捞偏门的顶，再往上就剩两级了——真可以接触到大老虎的龙头大哥和大老虎自己了。", "char_start": 1667, "char_end": 1717}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "但拜各路“懂事”的大哥所赐，到龙头老大这一级已经洗得很白了，所以背后的老虎们也更安全。", "char_start": 1718, "char_end": 1761}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "直到大哥这一级，其实都是耗材，出事是没人保的，只是大哥们会有安家费、封口费。大哥们出事概率仍然很高。", "char_start": 1762, "char_end": 1812}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "所以大哥这一级反而往往“家教”很严，心心念念想要儿子女儿洗白上岸，去当医生当律师，绝不会想ta们子承父业。谁会想要自己的娃接力当耗材？", "char_start": 1813, "char_end": 1880}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "你要半途而废的不善良，你能超出这一级的可能性还不到十分之一，只是八九在小混混的阶段就已经不是被抓了就是被缅甸了。能做到有字号这一级还能一辈子不炸雷，混到安全退休的，还不到三十分之一。", "char_start": 1881, "char_end": 1972}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "讽刺的是，你要是平时生活直接遇到了这三十分之一，就会发现ta们真是温和热情，豁达通透，“和善”得不行，比谁都低调老实——这也是ta们混的到退休的根源。", "char_start": 1973, "char_end": 2048}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "这类大哥说来也好笑，别看偏门出身，但是毒、杀这类冤孽大的都不愿意碰，平时教小弟也走的是“多用脑”路子，打打杀杀的蠢人也不爱收。", "char_start": 2049, "char_end": 2112}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "ta们最清楚善良的价值和威力，可惜自己渴望而不可及了罢了。", "char_start": 2113, "char_end": 2142}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "要到龙头大哥这一级，因为有两层耗材保护，才有可能有比较大的把握坐稳，真的做到世代以恶为业。但那个前提也是作为龙头老大能把这些层叠的恶所产生的利润充分的运营起来，能把每一份安家费都付足。还要懂得一切江湖规矩，官场禁忌，又要懂企业运营，市场产品。", "char_start": 2144, "char_end": 2265}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "这是真的才干，真的本事，完全可以去商学院讲讲课了。", "char_start": 2266, "char_end": 2291}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "这些人是真的可以向自己的子女传承知识和资源，形成犯罪家族的——前提是ta们真的会选择这么做。而会选择这样做的，一般都是因为所处的社会从法律层面对这些地下秩序睁一眼闭一眼。", "char_start": 2292, "char_end": 2377}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "会对这些灰色秩序睁一眼闭一眼，是资本主义社会的胎里病。中国从古至今都没有这么干过，更别提社会主义中国了。", "char_start": 2378, "char_end": 2430}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "所以在中国，龙头大哥们往往争取一代洗白，下一代做正当事业，很少选传给子女。", "char_start": 2431, "char_end": 2468}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "因此中国很难产生根深蒂固的纯以黑产为土壤的有家族传承的稳定的黑社会，通常只有以反政府为特色的造反组织（如洪门、白莲教）和有一定暴力行为的行会组织（如盐帮、漕帮）。", "char_start": 2469, "char_end": 2550}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "真正黑产性质的能在家族内代际传承的黑社会组织，只出现在港、台、美这类处在资本主义生态的华人社会里。", "char_start": 2551, "char_end": 2600}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "甚至在新加坡都很难生存。", "char_start": 2601, "char_end": 2613}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "国际上能真的稳定存在的家族性犯罪组织的原因也一样。", "char_start": 2614, "char_end": 2639}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "但这个等级，很显然不是你这种“善良不下去想不善良”的水平所能指望的——这水平，只有绝对的精英有机会，这往往是一些前中高级军官或者前精英情报人员才能到达的高度。", "char_start": 2640, "char_end": 2719}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "那往往不是ta们自己选的，而是时代造成的。", "char_start": 2720, "char_end": 2741}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "嘴里叫着“善良没前途”，吵着要“不善良”的小屁孩，99%都会在前两级被直接消耗掉。", "char_start": 2742, "char_end": 2783}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "再说一遍——你要动了这念头，被人诈了一笔钱就放过了你，这算最幸运的。", "char_start": 2784, "char_end": 2818}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "不要七想八想，善良已经是最短、最直的路。", "char_start": 2820, "char_end": 2840}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 69}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0207"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：就算这个社会很复杂也应该一直保持善良吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060"], "summary": "围绕“保持善良”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“就是因为社会很复杂，你才应该一直保持善良。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "就是因为社会很复杂，你才应该一直保持善良。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7cedc0c1-5f45-5879-a4e8-4ed8b9b11b25", "source_ordinal": 2746, "reading_ordinal": 1307, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "小吉尼斯", "published_at": "2022-06-13T16:10:07+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/68145666/answer/2527010015"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "引导子女在小时候就学会自我挑战——尤其是体育类、制作类的项目。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "最简单的比如学游泳，挑战更长的游泳距离。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "学跳绳，挑战一分钟跳出的最多次数。", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "学篮球，挑战三分钟投进球数。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "学做航模飞机，挑战最久滞空时间。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "学做四驱车，挑战最高圈速。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "打开吉尼斯世界纪录，找一找不影响健康和安全的那些，都可以试试。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这是小孩子体验这些东西最好的时机。", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "做个示范，教ta入门，只要ta体会到了基本的快乐，这些挑战都是没有底线的，什么样的闲暇时间都可以占满。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你要想的话，那就冲击吉尼斯世界纪录。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "什么样奇怪的技艺也罢，顶球也罢，转铅笔也罢，飞扑克也罢，重在锲而不舍、精益求精，练出心得，练出卓越，练出自信。", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "父母在这期间可以做大量的心理辅导和鼓励工作。比如找资料，做技术分析，带着去同行交流，请教专家。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而最重要的，是帮ta做记录，培养ta做记录的习惯和艺术。", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "其实人难以坚持努力的一个主要的原因，就是看不到努力的可视化的成果，没有一个肉眼可见的事物在变大、变厚、变长。", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "要培养子女的坚持，不是靠批评ta们不坚持、没毅力、不是靠奖励蛋糕冰激凌、不是靠举名人故事、不是靠痛心疾首或者语言奖励。", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而是要靠对记录的重视。", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "凡练习，必记录，凡挑战，必留痕迹。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 515}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这一点你跟游戏学学。为了个完美过关、为了排行榜上的等级、为了个神装甚至只是个名字的颜色，你娃多能熬？", "char_start": 516, "char_end": 566}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "ta们甚至可以重打一遍，就为了录个屏。", "char_start": 567, "char_end": 586}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这种向着挑战世界纪录努力的体验，对塑造子女的人格和价值观有很大的造就。", "char_start": 588, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "一旦迷上，既成事业。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "从此ta再也不会满足于“比上不足比下有余”，干什么都会很容易进顶流。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "顶流相通。", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 675}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0207"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子小小年纪总觉得无聊，父母该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“小吉尼斯”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“引导子女在小时候就学会自我挑战——尤其是体育类、制作类的项目。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "引导子女在小时候就学会自我挑战——尤其是体育类、制作类的项目。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e9e8c3ae-0066-52ff-97e7-49eb120c12ba", "source_ordinal": 2745, "reading_ordinal": 1308, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "戒指", "published_at": "2022-06-14T02:25:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/39725404/answer/2527699364"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "喜欢？合眼缘？这种挑选标准不靠谱。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "要么根据用途来挑——", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "准备传代，那要考虑独一性，就是那种卖了几十年，卖家还想出钱回收回店里或者经常来找你借去参展的。这种值得再配上吊坠、耳环、胸针一套。参加皇家舞会都够了。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "世代传家，只会升值。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "准备朴素的传代，也就是象征自己，回头通过儿子传给儿媳妇，那就要考虑做人风格、家族座右铭之类。重在刻字和象征意义。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "准备日常戴，那就不考虑大钻，找一看就经得起残酷考验的厚圈。回头开车洗碗摘来摘去弄丢了心疼，不摘搞得灰头土脸也糟蹋东西。", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "准备配衣服，那就看你选什么婚纱或晚礼服。彩色宝石挺好的。", "char_start": 233, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所谓“合眼缘”最不靠谱，基本属于浪费钱——过几天睡一觉，眼缘就变了。", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "其实现在不妨买裸钻请设计师定制。", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "先想好自己想干嘛。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 323}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0207"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：Chaumet , Tiffany &Co, Bvlgari 怎么选？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“戒指”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“喜欢？合眼缘？这种挑选标准不靠谱。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "喜欢？合眼缘？这种挑选标准不靠谱。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
